Tempo Warp audio (Phase 0)
==========================

All gameplay audio is currently synthesized at runtime with Tone.js
(procedural oscillators / synths). No third-party sample packs are bundled yet.

Modes:
  default (stems-style layered pads)  — soft sine / triangle layers + light delay
  ?audio=proc                         — brighter, more synthetic bed

When real CC stem files are added under this folder, list their licenses here.
